WEBVTT

01:29.650 --> 01:33.090
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.610 --> 01:36.229
[Episode 10]

01:37.080 --> 01:39.039
Although we just met not long ago,

01:39.509 --> 01:40.350
we share

01:40.400 --> 01:42.550
the same desire to survive.

01:42.720 --> 01:43.240
Spill it.

01:43.240 --> 01:44.300
What's the matter?

01:44.520 --> 01:45.979
I'm just trying to tell you

01:46.200 --> 01:48.570
that there is a mole among us.

01:48.960 --> 01:49.640
Who is it?

01:50.270 --> 01:52.200
I'm not entirely sure who it is yet,

01:52.520 --> 01:54.180
but I have a way to find her out.

01:54.600 --> 01:55.580
Why should I believe you?

01:55.580 --> 01:57.240
Giving it a try won't harm you.

01:57.520 --> 01:59.580
The thing is, if we don't root her out,

01:59.860 --> 02:01.190
we might all be doomed

02:01.600 --> 02:03.700
in tomorrow's death match.

02:32.550 --> 02:33.470
Miss Nan,

02:33.490 --> 02:34.770
you're so smart.

02:35.360 --> 02:36.360
Wan,

02:36.680 --> 02:38.360
how about we just skip the talk?

02:38.360 --> 02:41.520
For once, I finally had the mood to play
a guessing game with you girls.

02:41.520 --> 02:42.720
Little did I expect

02:42.800 --> 02:44.760
my identity would be revealed so soon.

02:44.760 --> 02:46.560
You do know how to enjoy yourself,

02:46.560 --> 02:48.760
Lord Voice-Keeper,
for joining a death match yourself.

02:48.760 --> 02:51.290
I wonder if you will jump
into the den of snakes

02:51.720 --> 02:52.920
the same when you lose?

02:52.920 --> 02:54.120
Guards!

02:56.680 --> 02:57.640
Hold on.

03:03.990 --> 03:06.920
Just now, you claimed to bet the lives

03:07.080 --> 03:09.940
of all the female prisoners here
on the third round.

03:10.440 --> 03:11.670
Are you aware

03:11.960 --> 03:13.640
how high the stakes are?

03:33.160 --> 03:35.140
Our plan is to take a gamble.

03:36.400 --> 03:37.200
Fine.

03:37.800 --> 03:39.030
Then tell me.

03:39.240 --> 03:40.640
How do you want to proceed

03:40.790 --> 03:41.840
with the third round?

03:41.840 --> 03:43.400
Both of us will each roll a dice and guess

03:43.400 --> 03:45.120
the other's number after the dices land.

03:45.120 --> 03:46.440
Whoever guesses correctly wins.

03:46.440 --> 03:47.770
One game decides it all.

03:47.840 --> 03:48.960
What do you say?

03:49.079 --> 03:49.720
I agree.

03:51.320 --> 03:52.480
Let's do as you said.

04:05.000 --> 04:07.800
This is the third round
of the current death match.

04:08.660 --> 04:09.540
Ladies,

04:10.280 --> 04:11.280
please get ready.

04:15.460 --> 04:16.320
If Miss Nan loses,

04:16.320 --> 04:17.959
we'll have to die with her.

04:18.279 --> 04:19.519
If you're that worried,

04:19.519 --> 04:21.120
go play the game yourselves.

04:21.360 --> 04:22.690
Will Yanzhi win?

04:23.200 --> 04:23.960
Stop with this.

04:23.960 --> 04:24.800
No more rubbing.

04:24.800 --> 04:26.520
My palms are already sweating.

04:26.520 --> 04:28.120
Ladies, get ready.

04:28.680 --> 04:31.280
The final round of this death match

04:32.300 --> 04:33.420
begins now.

05:15.880 --> 05:18.250
If the plan can be carried out at the end,

05:18.400 --> 05:20.640
I hope you will help me with your ability
to tell dice numbers

05:20.640 --> 05:21.280
by sound.

05:22.090 --> 05:23.350
Why should I help you?

05:23.630 --> 05:26.090
You also long to leave this place,
don't you?

05:26.400 --> 05:27.600
I suppose it takes more than

05:27.600 --> 05:30.200
an individual's effort
to win the voice-keeper.

05:30.200 --> 05:31.600
Only by working together

05:31.760 --> 05:33.180
do we stand a chance of victory.

05:33.180 --> 05:34.470
We are hardly friends.

05:35.800 --> 05:37.200
Why would you trust me?

05:37.390 --> 05:39.030
We will be friends after this.

05:39.030 --> 05:41.030
I firmly believe we will all get out

05:41.080 --> 05:42.159
of here at last.

05:43.760 --> 05:45.420
After I identify the dice number,

05:45.420 --> 05:48.030
I'll tell you what it is
by blinking my eyes.

06:27.760 --> 06:28.560
Sorry.

06:35.480 --> 06:37.340
I guess the number of your dice...

06:39.880 --> 06:40.680
is one.

07:53.680 --> 07:54.640
What now?

07:54.680 --> 07:57.280
Have you lost your ability to speak
like the mute servant?

07:57.280 --> 07:59.120
She already waived her turn to guess.

07:59.120 --> 08:01.250
Why don't you announce the result now?

08:09.430 --> 08:11.030
The winner of the third round

08:11.210 --> 08:12.620
is Nan Yanzhi.

08:25.120 --> 08:26.320
Take them down!

08:28.600 --> 08:29.200
What?

08:29.440 --> 08:31.370
Are you going back on your word now?

08:33.950 --> 08:34.750
Wan,

08:35.120 --> 08:36.520
you could've defeated her.

08:36.520 --> 08:38.400
Why did you deliberately let her go?

08:38.400 --> 08:39.679
To err is human.

08:40.240 --> 08:43.600
I misheard her dice this time.

08:46.200 --> 08:48.440
But I've never seen you err before.

08:54.200 --> 08:57.260
Does this have something to do
with Zhuang Wujiu again?

09:03.120 --> 09:03.680
Wan,

09:04.080 --> 09:05.400
previously, you were deceived by her

09:05.400 --> 09:06.660
and made a grave mistake already.

09:06.660 --> 09:08.680
How could you recklessly believe her again

09:08.680 --> 09:10.280
and take one more wrong step?

09:19.600 --> 09:20.720
We must not break

09:20.720 --> 09:22.720
the rules of death matchs.

09:25.210 --> 09:26.870
But have you thought about...

09:35.080 --> 09:35.880
Zan,

09:37.990 --> 09:39.520
I've made up my mind.

09:59.930 --> 10:02.600
It never occurred to me
that the great Lord Voice-Keeper

10:02.600 --> 10:04.400
would break her word.

10:06.200 --> 10:07.400
It's impossible to let you

10:07.400 --> 10:08.530
take everyone away.

10:08.840 --> 10:09.880
However,

10:10.650 --> 10:12.810
we can give you some gold

10:12.840 --> 10:14.840
so you can reach the fourth floor

10:14.880 --> 10:16.160
effortlessly.

10:20.350 --> 10:22.350
I must take all the girls away.

10:22.600 --> 10:24.360
Don't push your luck!

10:24.400 --> 10:25.080
Zan,

10:26.210 --> 10:27.280
please leave the room.

10:27.280 --> 10:28.650
I'd like a word with her in private.

10:28.650 --> 10:29.060
Wan...

10:29.080 --> 10:30.410
I'm asking you to leave.

10:40.000 --> 10:40.680
Tell me.

10:41.250 --> 10:43.000
Why do you insist on
taking all the girls with you

10:43.000 --> 10:44.270
and refuse to leave by yourself?

10:44.270 --> 10:46.070
Because I've made them a promise

10:46.240 --> 10:47.660
that I'd get them out of here with me.

10:47.660 --> 10:48.400
What did you just say?

10:48.400 --> 10:49.440
A promise?

10:49.760 --> 10:51.200
Ha-ha.

10:53.160 --> 10:56.660
You don't actually believe
that sort of stuff, do you?

10:57.640 --> 10:58.520
Why wouldn't I?

11:00.800 --> 11:02.240
The night is still young.

11:02.380 --> 11:03.320
How about...

11:03.800 --> 11:05.560
I tell you a story?

11:06.200 --> 11:07.600
Ten years ago,

11:08.160 --> 11:09.330
in the Moon House,

11:09.880 --> 11:13.880
there was a famous courtesan
with unmatched pipa skills in the capital.

11:14.040 --> 11:14.880
Coincidentally,

11:14.880 --> 11:16.680
she was also called Ms. Kou.

11:17.800 --> 11:19.630
All I seek in my life

11:19.840 --> 11:21.130
is to spend every day

11:21.200 --> 11:24.170
playing musical instruments with you
harmoniously

11:25.400 --> 11:26.800
like this.

11:28.140 --> 11:29.940
May our happiness last forever.

11:30.440 --> 11:33.200
May our bond never fade from memory.

11:39.410 --> 11:41.360
Blessed to be with a beauty like you,

11:41.360 --> 11:42.890
I promise to stay committed

11:43.060 --> 11:44.410
to you for a lifetime.

11:44.610 --> 11:45.930
Hearing your words,

11:46.600 --> 11:47.720
I feel

11:49.310 --> 11:50.160
so fortunate.

11:56.310 --> 11:57.450
Ms. Kou!

11:57.800 --> 11:58.480
Mr. Xie...

11:58.500 --> 12:00.620
Mr. Xie was taken by the authorities!

12:03.170 --> 12:04.370
How did that happen?

12:04.400 --> 12:05.410
Mr. Xie is said to be

12:05.410 --> 12:08.040
engaged in the rebellion
conspired by Prince Xu and his aides.

12:08.040 --> 12:10.370
Prince Xu's matter involves many people.

12:10.420 --> 12:11.810
I must rescue Xie.

12:17.520 --> 12:18.760
Take these.

12:22.640 --> 12:24.080
If the money is still not enough,

12:24.080 --> 12:24.640
then...

12:33.220 --> 12:34.700
Then pawn this pipa.

12:34.730 --> 12:35.530
Ms. Kou,

12:35.650 --> 12:36.710
this red sandalwood pipa

12:36.710 --> 12:38.280
is your most precious possession.

12:38.280 --> 12:40.340
What pipa will you use if this is gone?

12:40.790 --> 12:42.990
There's no time to worry about that now.

12:43.460 --> 12:45.060
-Do as I said and go.
-Kou Wan!

12:54.410 --> 12:56.030
We're ordered to arrest Kou Wan,
an accomplice

12:56.030 --> 12:57.360
to a rebel surnamed Xie.

12:57.710 --> 13:00.110
Ms. Kou, you'll have to go with us.
